        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-471 (ensure controlled execution — Payment Cost, Fraud &amp; Tokenization Governance (PA-80.3).) | - operational: rule tuning and manual review
Owner: Fraud Operations Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
